# Workflow

## Concurrency

- Worker pool with default `CONCURRENCY=10`; never unlimited Xray processes.
- Each worker isolates ports and processes; no port collisions.

## Error handling

- One failed config must not crash the app. Return structured errors per config.
- Handle: invalid URL, missing Xray, startup timeout, connection/TLS/Reality/HTTP failures, GeoIP failure.

## CLI progress

```
[1/500] TESTING Estonia, Tallinn
[1/500] HEALTHY 1.2.3.4 | Estonia | Tallinn | 842ms
Progress: 2/500 | Healthy: 1 | Failed: 1
```

## Graceful shutdown (SIGINT/SIGTERM)

1. Stop starting new tests
2. Clean up active Xray processes and temp files
3. Save collected results to `results/results.csv` and `results/results.json`
4. Exit cleanly — no orphaned Xray processes

## Output fields

`index`, `status`, `vless_name`, `server`, `server_port`, `exit_ip`, `country`, `country_code`, `region`, `city`, `isp`, `asn`, `latency_ms`, `error`, `tested_at`
